  "description": "Zero-dependency .NET library that generates unique PNG avatars from a string identifier (email, phone, etc.). Fully managed PNG encoding — no SkiaSharp or native graphics. Deterministic by default, with per-call pattern, circle mask, colors, and seed normalization. GenerateBytes and GenerateToFile included.",
